                       -- ,MST_CONVERT_QTY,PLAN_WEEK,SPLIT_RESULT,ATTRIBUTE8,ATTRIBUTE9,ATTRIBUTE10
                       -- added by ytchoi 180305 measure 별 start와 end 일자 구하기
                      -- ,(
